WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.496
Step 1. Open the valueset list.

1.2
00:00:02.496 --> 00:00:08.510
Care shows a facility valueset only to members of the departments that it is shared

1.3
00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:14.951
with, and of their parent departments. In Settings, under Forms, select ValueSets.

2.1
00:00:14.951 --> 00:00:20.942
Step 2. Open the valueset. To find it by name, type in Search ValueSets.

2.2
00:00:20.942 --> 00:00:26.784
Then select Edit on its row, and Care opens the Edit ValueSet page.

3.1
00:00:26.784 --> 00:00:32.638
Step 3. Find the departments. Departments with access is below Basic Information.

3.2
00:00:32.638 --> 00:00:37.150
It shows the departments that the valueset is shared with.

4.1
00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:39.252
Step 4. Add a department.

4.2
00:00:39.252 --> 00:00:44.364
Select Select Department, and select the check box of the department.

4.3
00:00:44.364 --> 00:00:49.457
Care saves the change at once and shows Organizations updated.

5.1
00:00:49.457 --> 00:00:51.646
Step 5. Remove a department.

5.2
00:00:51.646 --> 00:00:56.216
Select the remove button next to its name, and Care saves at once.

5.3
00:00:56.216 --> 00:00:59.747
If you remove the departments that give you access,

5.4
00:00:59.747 --> 00:01:02.532
Care hides the valueset from you.
